| `INCURSION_MAPREAD_PROBE=<varid>` | Runs the generated `GetMemberVar` for member `m` on an item on no map and logs the result. Behind `check_script_map_read.sh`. |
| `INCURSION_VISION_PROBE=all\|keep\|load\|magicdark` | The item-vision vocabulary. `all` grants `SIGHT_FLOOR`, `VISION_SCALE`, `IGNORES_DARKNESS` and `IGNORES_OBSCURITY` in turn, measures what each moves and puts everything back; `keep` grants a permanent halving and leaves it for the session's save to carry; `load` reports what the save carried and what a fresh `CalcValues` makes of it. Behind `check_item_vision.sh`. | Mode `magicdark` is behind `check_magic_dark_sight.sh`.
